---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for Aj's Agent, a personal Google API client.">
  <main class="content-layer" style="max-width: 68ch; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 16px 64px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Privacy policy: Aj's Agent</h1>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      Aj's Agent is a personal Google API client used only by Ajeenkya Bhatalkar to work with his own
      Google account (Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Docs and Sheets) from his own computer. It is not offered
      to anyone else.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      Data accessed through Google APIs stays on the owner's own devices. It is not sold, shared with
      third parties, used for advertising, or used to train models. OAuth tokens are stored in the local
      system keychain and can be revoked at any time from
      <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" style="text-decoration: underline;">Google Account permissions</a>.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      Use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the
      <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" style="text-decoration: underline;">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
      including the Limited Use requirements.
    </p>
    <p>Questions: ajeenkyab@gmail.com. Last updated October 4, 2026.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
